From: Cristian Papa <pcristian292@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] econet: normalize WHNAT immediate-done and lab seams

Carry the exact hardware-tested build_dir state into a cleanly reproducible
package patch, including the BQL-safe devless injectors and the PON seam that
had previously existed only as loose build_dir edits.

The OEM LAN QDMA enables TX_IMMEDIATE_DONE for QDMA->PPE->QDMA because that
internal route never crosses GDM and therefore has no normal pkt_done. Keep the
bit disabled by default, expose a readback-verified runtime switch, and count
marked probe completions independently.

